    essence:'Angra Mainyu is the most explicit expression of cosmic dualism in world religion. Where Ahura Mazda creates life, Angra Mainyu creates death. The Vendidad lists 99,999 diseases as his counter-creations. He is not a creator but a parasite on creation — a pure principle of opposition. At the end of time his power will be broken.',
